{
  "name": "Computational Experiment",
  "abstract": "OGC API Records profile for describing a computational experiment realising a documented model. Points at the executable code that runs the experiment (any language / format that exists and runs — Python, Jupyter, R, …), and binds it to the documented model (an ODD record), the evidence equation (an `equation-property-relationship` record), and to standalone input records (one per data class) and `experiment-output` records, all referenced by URI.",
